          "short": "$u=x$, $u'=1$; $v=2x^2-1$, $v'=4x$; $y'=\\dfrac{-2x^2-1}{(2x^2-1)^2}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}u&=x,&u'&=1\\\\v&=2x^2-1,&v'&=4x\\\\y'&=\\frac{u'v-uv'}{v^2}\\\\y'&=\\frac{1(2x^2-1)-x(4x)}{(2x^2-1)^2}\\\\y'&=\\frac{2x^2-1-4x^2}{(2x^2-1)^2}\\\\y'&=\\frac{-2x^2-1}{(2x^2-1)^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
